./xmodel/sol-avenues2.md:207:In the generic B-unramified/x-simple passport recorded in `GROK-MONODROMY.md` §1e, the compactified fibre has genus 18, hence 18 independent pairings. The recorded genus-zero specialization has no holomorphic differentials and is an honest no-traction sector; any proof claim must enumerate that sector rather than silently use \(g=18\) universally.
