+ \frac{(C^4h_1)^3}{(C^3f)^4}=\frac{h_1^3}{f^4}.                         \tag{3.6}
+\]
+
+The characteristic denominator of the carrier `C` is absent from (3.6).
+The two-pole handshake fixes the pole order `3` in (3.1); (3.4) shows
