+
+The single sufficient inequality left by the degree route is
+
+> **CONJECTURE A-SCALE.** There is `B_A` such that every orbitwise
+> degree-minimal, nonautomorphic residue-A pair with Sigray rectangle base
+> `(a,b)` satisfies
+> \[
+>     a+b\leq B_A.                                                        \tag{0.5}
