+\]
+
+It leaves the two pole entries `(a_P,b_P,nu_P)=(1,1,2)`, hence
+
+\[
+ \mathcal E_{\rm MR}=1,qquad \operatorname{td}=6,qquad \deg\Psi=36,   \tag{1.4}
+\]
+
+unchanged at H1 tier.
+
