+`(a,b)`. Thus
+
+\[
+\begin{aligned}
+ \operatorname{Supp}f&\subseteq[0,2a]\times[0,2b],
+ & [x^{2a}y^{2b}]f&\ne0,\\
+ \operatorname{Supp}g&\subseteq[0,3a]\times[0,3b],
