+## 3. Constant Jacobian on a residue-A pole
+
+Let `t` be the primitive parameter of a residue-A pole branch of a generic
+fiber `f=a_0`. Write
+
+\[
+ \operatorname{ord}_t x=-\kappa_i,qquad
+ \operatorname{ord}_t g=-3.                                            \tag{3.1}
