+
+Every claimed mechanism above fails at the correct place for the automorphism
+tower of `sol-k2c.md`.
+
+1. Its reduced type is `(1,2)`, not `(2,3)`. The coordinate-cusp exclusion
+   requires both weights greater than one. For `(1,2)`,
