+      =\frac{(\kappa_r-1)(\kappa_r-2)}2.                                \tag{6.2}
+   \]
+   Hence even a large positive embedded conductor is not an Aut-orbit
+   invariant. After minimization the fiber is a line and this conductor is
+   zero.
