+   Z\text{-order}=5B-2\text{ grows with }B\\
+\text{semigroup / conductor}
+ &c(P_i)\geq2(\kappa_i-1)\text{ is a lower bound; no fixed upper budget}
+\end{array}                                                             \tag{7.1}
+\]
