+ H_q^{-1}(U,V)=(U^q-V,U).                                                \tag{2.2}
+\]
+
+Both maps in (2.2) are polynomial automorphisms with Jacobian `1`.
+\(\square\)
+
+The missing converse is load-bearing: an approximate root in the completed
