+
+**Date:** 2026-08-23  
+**Characteristic:** `0`  
+**Inputs accepted as proved:** `xmodel/sol-k2c.md`,
+`xmodel/sol-bdelay.md`, and `xmodel/sol-unify.md` (read in full).
